{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "3c99cdf517117e41c4284d9534af125da81c63de9452c092fbbea56356a394a5", "ja": "え～、確かに、ちょっと久しぶりだけど……\nそこまでじゃないっしょ！", "zh": "欸～虽然确实是有一阵子没来了……\n但也不至于迷路吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
