{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "bf2484510f89264ccdfd1326c3a825cdda4728583347c9e1b038c565113b97fa", "ja": "あ……エレナ、恵美！", "zh": "啊……艾莲娜、惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4b091b73fca9f126ee2e5d5bb40c002b92c2eb2200d792ff0f6b79b4f5b78648", "ja": "もー、遅いよ琴葉～。\nアタシもエレナも、待ちくたびれちゃったよ？", "zh": "真是的，琴叶你也太慢啦～。\n我和艾莲娜都等得不耐烦了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "db833d6d64b316bc42c1081d3b35f31118d3cff029248f9ac8e2cce080902f31", "ja": "ごめんね、ふたりとも。\nすっかり遅くなっちゃって……。", "zh": "抱歉，让你们俩久等了。\n不小心拖到这么晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "5f6d88a8ea2c488107f138509457dc43d8fed51f6e7e9ac9d0ce970535eff51f", "ja": "帰りがけに、先生から「資料を運ぶのを手伝って\n欲しい」って頼まれちゃって。それで……。", "zh": "回去的时候，老师拜托我“帮忙搬一下\n资料”。所以就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "5664d0e30bb2c342a2ba168170f4d37e2f7cd646a764faf4757c7c6b509726c5", "ja": "またー！？\nもう、琴葉ってばホント断れないんだから～！", "zh": "又来～！？\n真是的，琴叶你真的太不擅长拒绝别人了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf4af28ff11f77610617afd25866073ebabc638bf1a7c272469bc57dcabbe8d1", "ja": "「友達と約束がある」って、言えばいいのにネー。", "zh": "只要说“和朋友有约”就行了嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3952c4a0c63c375778374b0028bf36f7e35375bf039f0a38c59356abcd9e6d6", "ja": "そ、そうなんだけど。\nでも、先生も困ってたし……。", "zh": "话、话是这么说啦。\n但是，老师也很为难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_002_017kth_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_002_017kth_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "534a6f3309171bef2be84dd5cf687b910e9433eef08f75de102f1efff72eda14", "ja": "コトハは優しいネー。イイコイイコ♪", "zh": "琴叶真温柔呢～。乖乖乖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
